OL,3,AZoe Kleinman: Nvidia CEO's affair will
OL,4,Acause ripples across US and beyond
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tech world has spent the day
OL,7,Fdigesting the extraordinary news that
OL,8,FJensen Huang - the charismatic,
OL,9,Fleather-jacket wearing chief executive
OL,10,Fof the multi-trillion dollar firm
OL,11,FNvidia - is being investigated by his
OL,12,Fown company over an extramarital affair
OL,13,Fwith a woman alleged to be a Chinese
OL,14,Fspy.
OL,16,FNone of us had that on our bingo cards
OL,17,Ffor 2026.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,112,105,200,160,0,100
