OL,3,AZoe Kleinman: Nvidia CEO's affair will
OL,4,Acause ripples across US and beyond
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuang's alleged romantic affair with
OL,7,FAlice Huang (no relation), the former
OL,8,FCEO of a Singapore-based data centre
OL,9,Fcompany, has cast ripples far beyond
OL,10,Fhis immediate family - undoubtedly on
OL,11,Fan emotional rollercoaster of their own
OL,12,F- taking us to a crossroads at which
OL,13,Ftechnology, geopolitics and national
OL,14,Fsecurity intersect.
OL,16,FIn a nutshell, this is about the bitter
OL,17,Frivalry between the US and China, as
OL,18,Fwell as whether Jensen Huang has
OL,19,Fbetrayed the US as well as his wife.
